      "gloss": "to claim",
      "meaning": "φάσκω [in LXX: Gen.26:20 (אָמַר), Dan LXX Bel 1:8 , 2Ma.14:27 2Mac 14:32 , 3Ma.3:7 * ;] to affirm, assert : with accusative and inf., Act.24:9 25:19 ; with inf. and nom., Rom.1:22. † (AS)"
    },
